WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.087
Yemen — where Canadian weapons kill.

00:00:03.037 --> 00:00:10.150
Saudi Arabia used coalition forces to bomb Yemen, creating the world's worst humanitarian crisis.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:14.987
Canadian-made Light Armoured Vehicles were documented in the conflict zone.
